[[File:Redstarbird.svg|thumb|right|250px|The Rebel Alliance starbird]]
The '''Rebel Alliance starbird''',<ref name="Ultimate">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> also known as the '''Alliance crest''', or as the '''Resistance crest''',<ref name="TLJVD">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> was a symbol of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]]. The [[flight helmet]]s of the [[Rebel pilot|Rebel]] [[T-65B X-wing starfighter|X-wing]] [[pilot]]s were adorned with the [[starbird]] logo.<ref name="ANH">{{Film|IV}}</ref> The former rebel [[shock trooper]] [[Carasynthia Dune|Cara Dune]] had the Alliance starbird [[tattoo]]ed on her cheek.<ref name="Chapter 16">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 16: The Rescue}}</ref> Nearly thirty [[Standard year|years]] after the [[Battle of Endor]], the [[Resistance]] adopted the same emblem. Many [[Resistance pilot|pilots]], including [[Poe Dameron]], wore [[helmet]]s featuring the logo.<ref name="TFA">{{Film|VII}}</ref> The [[New Republic]] [[Sigil of the New Republic|insignia]] also had the starbird.<ref name="Visual">''[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref>

It was created by combining the [[Starbird (symbol)|personal signature]] of [[Mandalorian]] [[artist]] [[Sabine Wren]] and the [[Saw's symbol|three-pronged symbol]] used by [[Saw Gerrera]].<ref name="AB Update">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know, Updated and Expanded]]''</ref>

==Uses==
The [[starbird]] was depicted on many objects and symbols, including:

